#: includes/class-admin.php
msgid "Show message: where the blocked script would show content (reviews, booking, a map), show a message with an accept button instead of an empty gap. Not needed for tracking scripts."
msgstr ""
"Mostrar mensaje: donde el script bloqueado mostraría contenido (reseñas, "
